  "description": "\"Mmm…\" Serbia let out a faint moan, still half-asleep. 'It's heavy.' Her whole body felt as heavy as water-soaked cotton. Dull aches wracked her entire frame, but the most uncomfortable part right now was her waist. It felt as though a heavy club was pressing down hard upon it—. 'Huh?' Feeling a strange sense of dissonance, Serbia snapped her eyes open. It wasn't just feeling like something was pressing down on her; something was indeed tightly pressing against her waist. It wasn't a club, but a man's arm, solidly woven with muscle.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285003245)",
